<title>SPAIN: Spain's Nov trade deficit was 140.1 bln ptas.</title>
<headline>Spain's Nov trade deficit was 140.1 bln ptas.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The customs department of the Economy Ministry gave the following figures (billions of pesetas):</p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE		NOV 96	 OCT 96     NOV 95</p>
<p> Exports		     1,212.9	1,296.9     1,104.8</p>
<p> Imports		     1,353.0	1,463.0     1,320.9</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	    -140.1	 -166.0	-216.1</p>
<p> Def/surplus yr to date -2,343.2     -2,203.1    -2,722.7</p>
<p>NOTE - The figures are customs-cleared data.  </p>
<p> TRADE BALANCE (EU)     NOV 96	  OCT 96	NOV 95</p>
<p> Exports		    869.7	   889.8	  826.9</p>
<p> Imports		    922.5	   983.8	  891.2</p>
<p> Deficit/surplus	  -52.9	   -94.0	  -64.2</p>
<p> Deficit yr to date    -883.4	  -830.5     -1,004.2</p>
</text>
